{"title":"2012 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the diagram, all angles are right angles and the lengths of the sides are given in centimeters. Note the diagram is not drawn to scale. What is , <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a47ca0fe7cb276abc022af6ac88ddae1a9d6894.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> in centimeters?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/d/bcd57a9d78159bce4d3873f81f5d879beaed1d5a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] pair A,B,C,D,E,F,G,H,I,J,K,L,M,N,O,P,Q,R; A=(4,0); B=(7,0); C=(7,4); D=(8,4); E=(8,5); F=(10,5); G=(10,7); H=(7,7); I=(7,8); J=(5,8); K=(5,7); L=(4,7); M=(4,6); N=(0,6); O=(0,5); P=(2,5); Q=(2,3); R=(4,3); draw(A--B--C--D--E--F--G--H--I--J--K--L--M--N--O--P--Q--R--cycle); label(&quot;$X$&quot;,(3.4,1.5)); label(&quot;6&quot;,(7.6,1.5)); label(&quot;1&quot;,(7.6,3.5)); label(&quot;1&quot;,(8.4,4.6)); label(&quot;2&quot;,(9.4,4.6)); label(&quot;2&quot;,(10.4,6)); label(&quot;3&quot;,(8.4,7.4)); label(&quot;1&quot;,(7.5,7.8)); label(&quot;2&quot;,(6,8.5)); label(&quot;1&quot;,(4.7,7.8)); label(&quot;1&quot;,(4.3,7.5)); label(&quot;1&quot;,(3.5,6.5)); label(&quot;4&quot;,(1.8,6.5)); label(&quot;1&quot;,(-0.5,5.5)); label(&quot;2&quot;,(0.8,4.5)); label(&quot;2&quot;,(1.5,3.8)); label(&quot;2&quot;,(2.8,2.6));[/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"195\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/4/ba4f6d7b82e535c4070d8d0899b66851cd993270.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\hspace{.05in}1\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\hspace{.05in}2\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\hspace{.05in}3\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\hspace{.05in}4\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\hspace{.05in}5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"351\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:2012amc85.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/3/3e/2012amc85.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"267\" height=\"219\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/3/e93358654e9042ad85225549853b1b9b806bdf3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 + 1 + 1 + 2 + X = 1 + 2 + 1 + 6\\\\ 5 + X = 10\\\\ X = 5$\" width=\"268\" height=\"52\" />\n</p><p>Thus, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/4/ff4e17770c29c8c67db0f0afab3567c122b1c499.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ 5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"53\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:Bcd57a9d78159bce4d3873f81f5d879beaed1d5a.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/b/b7/Bcd57a9d78159bce4d3873f81f5d879beaed1d5a.png/300px-Bcd57a9d78159bce4d3873f81f5d879beaed1d5a.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"232\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/b/b7/Bcd57a9d78159bce4d3873f81f5d879beaed1d5a.png/450px-Bcd57a9d78159bce4d3873f81f5d879beaed1d5a.png 1.5x, https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/b/b7/Bcd57a9d78159bce4d3873f81f5d879beaed1d5a.png 2x\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>Note that we only need to consider the value below the marked red line, so we have the equation:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/f/4df9ced0f2c10dfa5f6b6590a125d641804f37fc.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[X + 2 = 6 + 1\\]\" width=\"111\" height=\"14\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/2/d428366384771ecc1c4a712b9898e2c680a889a8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[X = 5\\]\" width=\"49\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>Hence, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/4/ff4e17770c29c8c67db0f0afab3567c122b1c499.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ 5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"53\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>~<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=User:Bloggish\" title=\"User:Bloggish\">Bloggish</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/m4g-Nmot-c8\">https://youtu.be/m4g-Nmot-c8</a> ~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_8\" title=\"2012 AMC 8\">2012 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2012 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2012 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2012\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2012 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\